<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ConsRutile yr net profit A$16.99 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ConsRutile yr net profit A$16.99 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  26.32 vs 18.73</p>
<p>    Net profit			  16.99 vs 12.34</p>
<p>    Sales				 75.15 vs 74.99</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		    nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Mineral sands miner Consolidated Rutile Ltd is a listed unit of Cudgen RZ Ltd, itself a listed subsidiary of RGC Ltd.</p>
